<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 2.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 2.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, May 2:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,450.00 (1,467.80)	CHF    993.29 (1,001.10)</p>
<p>    DEM    845.33 (854.17)	  GBP  2,354.20 (2,379.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    120.17 (121.34)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.17 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$16.72 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $33.89 million ($31.36 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
